// If skydiving with constrainedDive == true:
//	- Players may maneuver during skydive around a given 2D radius from the given destination. The further from the center, the less the player is able to freely skydive.
//  - Beyond the radius, player skydives straight down. Player can rotate to skydive toward the center of the circle and regain control.
const CONSTRAINEDDIVE_RADIUS_DEFAULT = 984.252 // 25m

